<title>USA: Omaha cattle up $.50/1.00 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Omaha cattle up $.50/1.00 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>OMAHA 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers were $.50-1.00 higher, said the USDA.</p>
<p>Slaughter Steers - Select to Choice 2-4, 1100-1300 lbs 65.50-66.50, load reputation mostly Choice 67.50.</p>
<p>Slaughter Heifers - Select to more Choice 2-4, 1050-1250 lbs 65.00-66.00.</p>
</text>
